guide polestar-completionist-alliance/class-paladin
title Paladin class quests (12-60) (Completionist)
faction Alliance
class Paladin
levels 12-60
category Class
zone Durotar
why Every Paladin class quest from level 10 on, in level order. The earlier ones are in the starting zone guides.
reward text What the Paladin quests give, quest by quest: abilities, forms, pets, totems or gear.
